ts_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":26987,"digest":"sha256:fb042be9c7a240068f81bb035e446e3f27cc3fa70da83021a94fbc4b2eddcaec","download_count":10798,"created_at":"2026-09-04T00:23:25Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T00:23:26Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/google/go-containerregistry/releases/download/v0.22.1/multiple.intoto.jsonl"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/go-containerregistry/tarball/v0.22.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/go-containerregistry/zipball/v0.22.1","body":"## What's Changed\r\n* Reject non-canonical IP literals in all SSRF guards by @shaggyinsomniac in https://github.com/google/go-containerregistry/pull/2426\r\n* daemon: fix stale docker/docker reference in WithClient docs by @BobDu in https://github.com/google/go-containerregistry/pull/2428\r\n* build(deps): bump the go-deps group across 2 directories with 4 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/google/go-containerregistry/pull/2422\r\n* authn: do not overwrite AuthConfig.Auth when username and password are empty by @nileshpatil6 in https://github.com/google/go-containerregistry/pull/2420\r\n* build(deps): bump the actions group across 1 directory with 8 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/google/go-containerregistry/pull/2423\r\n* Support pulling images by sha512 digest by @BobDu in https://github.com/google/go-containerregistry/pull/2427\r\n* Allow empty label and annotation values in crane mutate by @theadsingh in https://github.com/google/go-containerregistry/pull/2418\r\n* fix(build): Use dependencies.gitSource in cloudbuild_v2.yaml by @tprussak in https://github.com/google/go-containerregistry/pull/2434\r\n* validate: support index attestation manifests and empty configs by @Subserial in https://github.com/google/go-containerregistry/pull/2414\r\n* name: improve error when parsing a reference with a URL scheme by @locker95 in https://github.com/google/go-containerregistry/pull/2431\r\n* fix(build): install binaries to /ko-app and add to PATH (#2424) by @tprussak in https://github.com/google/go-containerregistry/pull/2436\r\n* fix(release): honor declared Go toolchain by @rksharma-owg in https://github.com/google/go-containerregistry/pull/2435\r\n* remote: apply checkRedirectSSRF to writer-side HTTP clients by @locker95 in https://github.com/google/go-containerregistry/pull/2432\r\n* flatten: preserve config and layer media types when flattening by @Subserial in https://github.com/google/go-containerregistry/pull/2438\r\n* fix(mutate): make Time layer updates lazy by @amarkdotdev in https://github.com/google/go-containerregistry/pull/2429\r\n* build(deps): bump the go-deps group across 2 directories with 3 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/google/go-containerregistry/pull/2439\r\n* remote: copy manifest annotations to referrers fallback tag descriptors by @codysoyland in https://github.com/google/go-containerregistry/pull/2441\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @shaggyinsomniac made their first contribution in https://github.com/google/go-containerregistry/pull/2426\r\n* @BobDu made their first contribution in https://github.com/google/go-containerregistry/pull/2428\r\n* @nileshpatil6 made their first contribution in https://github.com/google/go-containerregistry/pull/2420\r\n* @theadsingh made their first contribution in https://github.com/google/go-containerregistry/pull/2418\r\n* @locker95 made their first contribution in https://github.com/google/go-containerregistry/pull/2431\r\n* @rksharma-owg made their first contribution in https://github.com/google/go-containerregistry/pull/2435\r\n* @codysoyland made their first contribution in https://github.com/google/go-containerregistry/pull/2441\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/google/go-containerregistry/compare/v0.22.0...v0.22.1","mentions_count":11}